{"id":"steam-546500","steam":546500,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Tank it!","summary":"In Tank it! you command a drone to remotely control a heavy tank. You receive the mission to travel to remote villages, find and destroy the target military camps and eliminate all terrorists. But as in real life, there are many civilians in the villages, as well. The terrorists and civilians alike are at the player’s mercy. It is up to the player alone to decide how to handle this mission.","about":"Tank it! is made to communicate a clear message:\n \r\n#WarKills \r\n\r\nTank it! is a realistic and bloody war simulation game designed to show how brutal and dangerous war really is… that it is no good... that countless civilians are killed as collateral damage. \r\n\r\nIn Tank it! you command a drone to remotely control a heavy tank. You receive the mission to travel to remote villages, find and destroy the target military camps and eliminate all terrorists. But as in real life, there are many civilians in the villages, as well. The terrorists and civilians alike are at the player’s mercy. It is up to the player alone to decide how to handle this mission. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBernd Geiblinger: \"I for one do not enjoy playing brutal, bloody games, so for me it is painful to create death animations and blood. I did everything else before I did this kind of work - but I am doing it for the message. This is also why Tank it! will be available for a very low value - For me it is much more important to spread the message of the game than to earn a great deal of revenue.\"","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/portrait.png?t=1482265426","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/header.jpg?t=1482265426","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1482265426","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/header.jpg?t=1482265426","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1482265426","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_eb402be0840b7c451f7175591db427bdbb3e7929.600x338.jpg?t=1482265426","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_eb402be0840b7c451f7175591db427bdbb3e7929.jpg?t=1482265426"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_b01a79bf7678d1cfaf17efaa0d48d01c98936272.600x338.jpg?t=1482265426","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_b01a79bf7678d1cfaf17efaa0d48d01c98936272.jpg?t=1482265426"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_6cca2fd9a013782f7e52ccea547f87ee9591a7ec.600x338.jpg?t=1482265426","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_6cca2fd9a013782f7e52ccea547f87ee9591a7ec.jpg?t=1482265426"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_ab480fe539357c9b58ff3f9421b3d6d95ba9338e.600x338.jpg?t=1482265426","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_ab480fe539357c9b58ff3f9421b3d6d95ba9338e.jpg?t=1482265426"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_7ddbf75e298d69d2c61f037a8d3365358b2ba9f8.600x338.jpg?t=1482265426","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546500/ss_7ddbf75e298d69d2c61f037a8d3365358b2ba9f8.jpg?t=1482265426"}],"videos":[{"name":"Tank it! Early First Look","thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256673551/movie.293x165.jpg","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/546500/78326/49867cf478cf90511859f88bbb0f53326adef681/1751300287/hls_264_master.m3u8","mp4":null,"webm":null},{"n